                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一、指导思想：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">通过举办本届艺术节，展现我校素质教育的特质和我校素质教育的成果，深化教育教学改革，进一步丰富学生课外艺术活动的形式和内容，使学校艺术教育工作在全面推进素质教育的进程中科学、健康、持续、快速发展。面向全体学生，立足于提高审美修养和人文素养，促进德智体美劳全面发展，展现学生朝气蓬勃、昂扬向上的精神风貌。营造健康高雅的校园文化环境，体现向真、向善、向美、向上的校园文化特质。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">二、活动主题与内容</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">艺术节主题</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">践行</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">博雅</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">·畅艺传薪</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">”。高一、高二各班围绕艺术节的主题，开展丰富多彩的适合学生个性发展，展示艺术才华的艺术活动，结合爱国、爱校、爱家、爱学习、爱生活，创作一批具有</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">时代</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">特色，表现广大中学生</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">意趣</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">的作品。作品要求做到思想性和艺术性的统一，具有创新性，体现时代特征、校园特色、学生特点。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-weight: bold;font-size: 16px">三、</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">主要活动安排：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（一）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴一中</span>2021年校园文化艺术节开幕式（暨校园十佳歌手比赛）。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">预赛时间：</span>11月19日中午12：30 ,亚泉楼5011（音乐教室）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">决赛时间：</span>11月27日下午14：30正式开始。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">（二）、“欢乐青春”（原创）课本剧、小品、曲艺、器乐类比赛</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">比赛说明：课本剧、舞台剧、小品要求录音，服装、道具自行准备，时间严格控制在</span>8分钟之内。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评比时间：暂定高一</span>12月6日中午12:30 、高二12月7日中午12:30</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（三）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">“青春与梦想”歌曲、舞蹈比赛</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">比赛说明：表演形式以群舞为主</span>,人数不得少于8人。服装、配乐、道具等自行准备。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评比时间：暂定</span>12月8日中午12:30</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（四）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">新时代校园原创歌曲大赛</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">作品内容：积极、健康、向上，展示青春风采，传承中华美德，弘扬中国精神，树立良好的校风、学风等。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">投稿方式</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>1）作品分为两种类型：原曲填词、全原创歌曲</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>2）高一、高二 每班必须上交1-2个作品，两种类型均可，风格不限</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>3）整首歌音频、完整词曲、歌曲海报上交至公共文件夹</span><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">德育处</span>/2021校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，有条件者可附带上交</span>MV等。</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>4）自行截取40s以内的出彩部分，同时上交至公共文件夹德育处/2021校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛，以作为大众公投材料</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>5）截止日期：12月9日</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评选方式</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第一次评选：大众公投</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">高一高二每班派</span>3名代表参与投票，合唱社全体成员作为项目发起人同时参与投票，不占用班级代表名额。班级代表名单各班上交至公共文件夹德育处/2021校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛，名单递交截止日期12月6日。</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">在场聆听全部歌曲的出彩部分（没有上交出彩部分的作品，则从头开始播放至</span>30s）。歌曲播放顺序由各班代表抽签决定。</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">聆听完毕后进行投票。每人拥有</span>3票，每人不可重复投给同一首歌曲。</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">4</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">投票完毕后当场计票，产生前</span>10名，第1名为最佳人气奖</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">投票时间暂定</span>12月10日中午12:30 ，地点为阶梯教室4104</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第二次评选：专业点评</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">由专业老师评委进行打分评选</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;lin