楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">顾随</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">顾随诗词讲记</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">徐葆耕</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">西方文学之旅</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">洪子诚</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">百年新诗选（上下册）</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">里尔克</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">给一个青年诗人的十封信</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">卡夫卡</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">城堡</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">史铁生</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">务虚笔记</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">黑塞</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">纳尔齐斯与戈尔德蒙</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">卡尔维诺</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">看不见的城市</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">圣埃克苏佩里</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">小王子</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">刘义庆</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">世说新语</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">陈鼓应</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">《</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">庄子今注今译</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;">》</span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">摄影作品</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">参选对象：高二年段（欢迎高一、高三年段同学参与）</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">选取一个感兴趣的主题进行观察拍摄，每件作品包含</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">6张</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">组照</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，题材不限（人物、动物、风景、建筑、植物、活动等）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；作品可附加文字说明，便于明确表达。黑白或彩色皆可，大小</span>1兆以上，可以适当PS，拍摄器材不限。每位作者请把参赛作品打包</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（无需冲洗）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，并注明作品标题、作者姓名、班级</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，上传至公共文件夹</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:楷体">音美劳</span>-舒凤-2021艺术节摄影</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。参赛作品均不退还，主办方对参赛作品拥有使用权。凡投稿作者，均视为同意并遵守以上规定。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">“校园风貌”手绘明信片</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">参选对象：高二年段（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">欢迎高一、高三年段同学参与</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以绍兴一中校园</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">标志性</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">建筑景</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">物（南校门、图书馆、锡麟体育馆、银杏大道等）</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为主题</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">进行创作</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">手绘形式呈现，媒材不限（针管笔、彩铅、马克笔、水彩等），需</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体现学校特色，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">尺寸</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">不</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">超</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">过</span>16K</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left: 14px;line-height: 27px">
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（六）、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">闭幕式暨迎新春文艺会演</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">时间：暂定</span>12月18日分高一、高二两场进行（具体时间另行通知）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style=";font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">四、奖励办法：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> 艺术节设优秀组织奖、优秀节目奖若干名。各类比赛分设一、二、三等奖若干名。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">五、具体要求：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1.校园十佳歌手比赛以学生个人自愿报名为主，原则上各班不超过一个学生，并经过初选入围决赛。报名截止时间：11月18日中午。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2.活动安排</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中，第</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（二）、（三）项，要求以班级为单位，各班必须选送一个节目参加比赛，同时保证节目质量</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">报名截止时间</span>11月27日前</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；第</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（四）项，各班必须选送</span>1——2个参加评比</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；第（五）项美术类比赛第</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1条</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求高一各班至少选送一件（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">5-10页</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）作品，第</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2、3条</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求高二各班同时参与，每条至少选送一件作品。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3.各班要认真按照有关规定，组织相关活动及比赛，并及时上报活动组织情况。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:14px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">4.如有变化，以校网通知为准确，未尽事宜另行通知。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">202</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span>11月1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> 德育处、艺术组</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
